  "name": "Boring Log Viewer",
  "description": "Renders geotechnical boring logs from JSON, AGS4 or DIGGS data as standalone SVG drawings: graphic log with USCS and material symbols, material descriptions, samples, blow counts, laboratory specimens and groundwater. It also draws automatic cross-sections and a 3D layer model from several borings at a site. It runs as a web page in the browser, as a render API for scripts, and as a JavaScript module.",
